al Pixels and We can Classify from the Centre Which Shape is Defined. We are Planing to  Use RESNET - Residual Neural Networks or Similar to be able to argue and analyze the better  Accuracy between all of the Networks. ","topics":[],"score":216609,"global_rank":239540},{"name":"YanjunLin-Andrie/nba_draft_analysis","owner":"YanjunLin-Andrie","html_url":"https://github.com/YanjunLin-Andrie/nba_draft_analysis","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Experiments for Project 1","topics":[],"score":216609,"global_rank":239546},{"name":"gragollier/EECS-731-Project-1","owner":"gragollier","html_url":"https://github.com/gragollier/EECS-731-Project-1","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":216608,"global_rank":239551},{"name":"rohan20k/politicalNLPAnalysis","owner":"rohan20k","html_url":"https://github.com/rohan20k/politicalNLPAnalysis","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"This is a project/assignment related to classifying and predicting the label and sentiment of tweets from different US-based politicians. ","topics":[],"score":216608,"global_rank":239553},{"name":"vivekkr12/seattle-cats-and-dogs","owner":"vivekkr12","html_url":"https://github.com/vivekkr12/seattle-cats-and-dogs","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":216605,"global_rank":239587},{"name":"arkil/Medical_Text_Classification","owner":"arkil","html_url":"https://github.com/arkil/Medical_Text_Classification","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":216605,"global_rank":239593},{"name":"JY1148/my-dumbbell-curls-coach","owner":"JY1148","html_url":"https://github.com/JY1148/my-dumbbell-curls-coach","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":